				<r3d:description language="eng">Researchdata.se is a national web portal where you can find, share, and reuse research data from a wide range of disciplines.
The portal focuses on searchability and access to data, making it easy to navigate thousands of datasets to find what you are looking for. Researchdata.se also provides practical information on professional research data management in accordance with the FAIR principles, along with services and training resources from Swedish National Data Service (SND) and other national and international organizations.</r3d:description>
